{"id":"n34978-1-7","stage":4,"title":"구급차 · 急救车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34978-1-7-1","ko":"어젯밤에 갑자기 어머니가 쓰러지셨다면서요?","zh":"听说昨晚您母亲突然晕倒了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어젯밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"어젯밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어젯밤","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67078","senseId":"1","lemma":"어젯밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어젯밤에","audio":"/audio/993b356a7580926fa1bc.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니가","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니가","audio":"/audio/7180d98b45bfbcfa2667.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰러지셨다면서요?","meaning":"倒下","explanation":"쓰러지다：倒下；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"쓰러지다","audio":"/audio/656c81f444d0c0c6fddc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16492","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰러지셨다면서요","audio":"/audio/6ada546ea5f768d3a8d5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"faa5384e37664674","term":"어젯밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3","entryId":"67078","definition":"昨天的夜晚。","pronunciation":["어제빰","어젣빰"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3